abstract: "Local v1.0.0 release candidate. DFT and experimental tables are separate. Includes canonical-composition keys, proposed leakage-safe splits, own-paper exclusions and CPU reference and tuned baselines. Raw Starrydata curves and points are not redistributed. No archival DOI has been minted."
